From 51f737a2f54f97747d2a0089f6cee3a8f7ab4927 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 18:46:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(charter): narrow three no-any-return returns in agent
 profile repository (#4292)

`mypy --strict src/charter/offering/agent_profiles/repository.py` reported
three no-any-return errors on main. Under the `charter.*`
follow_imports=skip override, `AgentProfile.routing_priority`,
`built_in_dir(...)` and `profile_channel_reachable(...)` resolve as `Any`
when the file is checked on its own, and each was returned straight from a
function declared `-> float`, `-> Path` and `-> frozenset[str]`.

Bind each value to an annotated local before returning it. No
`# type: ignore` and no behaviour change.

Add a mypy --strict gate test for the file, following the existing
mission_step_contracts / _read_path_resolver gate tests.
---
 .../offering/agent_profiles/repository.py     |  9 ++--
 .../test_repository_mypy_strict.py            | 42 +++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 48 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tests/doctrine/agent_profiles/test_repository_mypy_strict.py

diff --git a/src/charter/offering/agent_profiles/repository.py b/src/charter/offering/agent_profiles/repository.py
index de93b792..110df8be 100644
--- a/src/charter/offering/agent_profiles/repository.py
+++ b/src/charter/offering/agent_profiles/repository.py
@@ -161,7 +161,8 @@ def _score_profile(
